<title>USA: CNA buys stake in crop underwriter.</title>
<headline>CNA buys stake in crop underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNA Financial Corp said Friday it had purchased a 40 percent interest in the voting common stock of North American Crop Underwriters Inc.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>NACU underwrites multi-peril crop insurance, crop hail insurance, named peril insurance and farm insurance and is currently the non-exclusive program agent of CNA.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
